\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ |\n\nThen, we add a column for the part of the expression that's in parentheses, $P∧¬Q:$\n\n| $\\,P\\,$ | $\\,Q\\,$ | $\\,¬P\\,$ | $\\,¬Q\\,$ | $\\,P∧¬Q\\,$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ |\n\nFinally, we add a column for $¬P∨(P∧¬Q):$\n\n| $\\,P\\,$ | $\\,Q\\,$ | $\\,¬P\\,$ | $\\,¬Q\\,$ | $\\,P∧¬Q\\,$ | $\\,¬P∨(P∧¬Q)\\,$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ |" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-927d1c5b-7655-5055-b864-d18c0a8df3e9" "answer-field-053646c6-c1be-5d2a-83e7-f8d12ba1159d" "answer-field-4bea0603-ea43-5d5d-b04e-2147a341ee45" "answer-field-6a3b405b-c62a-50ce-8f47-28f67b376d14"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-927d1c5b-7655-5055-b864-d18c0a8df3e9" :answer-field/id #uuid "927d1c5b-7655-5055-b864-d18c0a8df3e9" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "answer-c3ed6a95-d61a-5feb-a4e5-83b61f5d7205" :answer-field/choices ["answer-c3ed6a95-d61a-5feb-a4e5-83b61f5d7205" "answer-71ca529c-3355-5390-a1a6-46a214ea694e"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-c3ed6a95-d61a-5feb